Error [E0120]: `resource` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> tests/ui/single_use_aliased.jet:7:28
    |
  7 |     return Lock.{resource: resource}
    |                            ^^^^^^^^
 Why: this function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: copy it explicitly with `~resource`

Error [E0142]: `db` can't be shared — it must be used exactly once
  --> tests/ui/single_use_aliased.jet:20:10
    |
 20 |     peek(db)
    |          ^^
 Why: this value's type is `#SingleUse`, so it can only be moved (handed over for good); `peek` would borrow or copy it, and a `#SingleUse` value has no second use to give
 Fix: move it with the move-capability marker `^` (`^db`) to give it away, or rework the call so it takes ownership through that marker
